{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally Comes Home"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Waiting For Luggage"}, {"type": "position", "content": 1}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Describe rooms, homes and objects in buildings in common social and work situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " When you make and respond to requests, remember to be polite!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Making Requests </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\"> Responding to Requests </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would you \u2026 ?<br />  I'd like to \u2026 <br /> Would you mind (if) \u2026 ?<br />  Would \u2026 be okay?<br />  I was wondering if \u2026 <br />  Could you \u2026 ?<br />  Do you think you could \u2026 ?<br /> Is there any chance you could \u2026 ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sure, I'll \u2026<br />  Sure, I'd be glad to \u2026<br /> No, not at all.<br /> Certainly.<br /> Yes, of course.<br /> I'll see what I can do.<br /> I don't mind at all.<br /> Of course we can \u2026<br /> No problem.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Would you mind telling me where the baggage claim area is?   "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Attendant</span>: Not at all. Take the escalator to your right. "}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Comparative and Superlative Adjectives"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use a comparative to compare somebody or something to <span class =\"strong\">one</span> other person or thing.<br /> You use a superlative to compare somebody or something to the whole <span class =\"strong\">group</span> that he, she or it belongs to."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul>  \t<li>You use <span class =\"strong\">than</span> after the comparative</li> \t<li>You add <span class =\"strong\">the</span> in front of the superlative form to describe people, places and things</li> </ul>   \t\t\t"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart for information on how to form the comparative and superlative:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Comparative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Superlative\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Form\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cold\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"colder (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the coldest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Most adjectives: +er, +-est\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"big\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" bigger (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" the biggest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"1-syllable words, with a consonant + a vowel + a consonant (cvc) at the end, double the final consonant + -er\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"late\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"later (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the latest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adjectives ending in -e: +r, +-st\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"happier (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the happiest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"2-syllable adjectives ending in -y: +ier, +iest\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"attractive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"more attractive (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the most attractive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"3+-syllable adjectives:  more + adjective+ than  most + adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"good<br />bad\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"better (than)<br /> worse (than)\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the best<br /> the worst\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Irregular comparisons\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Boston is colder than Cairo. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Cairo is bigger than Boston."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "time zone"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of the globe where clocks show the same time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Boston is in the Eastern Time Zone and is 6 hours behind Cairo."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in an airport at the Arrivals Hall."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "jetlag"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "physical effects you feel after a long trip across several time zones "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't deal with jetlag very well."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pamphlet"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a short booklet containing information about a subject "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to pick up a pamphlet on how to deal with jetlag."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "flight"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of traveling through the air"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The flight to Boston was long and tiring."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "turbulence"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an area of rough air during flight "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The plane entered an area of turbulence."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to adjust "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get used to something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need a few days to adjust to the time zone."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "border protection "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of showing your passport before entering a country"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The line for border protection was very long."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le14ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le14ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and look for a list of tips on how to deal with jetlag."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write down a list of 8-10 tips."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share the tips with your partner. Listen to your partner's tips."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about travel and transportation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a list of tips for dealing with jetlag."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I compare my list with other people's lists in my class."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob01re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn5le14ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Excuse me \u2026 ?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Yes, how may I help you?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Would you mind telling me where the baggage claim area is?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Not at all. Take the escalator down to the Arrivals Hall.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: The escalator right here?", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le14ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Yes. Follow the sign and look for your flight number on the big screen.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you. Could you tell me where the restroom is?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Certainly. It's at the end of the baggage claim area. Are you feeling ok?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes \u2026 it's just the jetlag. I need time to adjust to the time zone.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: It always takes a few days. Where did you depart from?", "id": 2, "time": "11000", "image": "engenn5le14ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Cairo. It was a long flight. We had a bit of turbulence as well, so I didn't sleep at all.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Boston is 6 hours behind Cairo. <br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's also much colder! I had to wear a jacket in the line for border protection!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Airport attendant</span>: Aw, I'm sorry. Would you like a pamphlet about dealing with jetlag?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure ...", "id": 3, "time": "31500", "image": "engenn5le14ob01re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about travel and transportation. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can make and respond to requests. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can compare two things."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Do you like traveling by plane? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "Are you a nervous flyer? Are you relaxed? "}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": "What do you like to do onboard a plane? "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}]}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": " Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": " Sally is back in Boston. It's good to be home!"}], "template_override": 1}, {"questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 0, "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0